it for sale?", "name": "YUSUF", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["rising"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Lenny sets the pot down.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "It rattles.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because your sister doesn't want it.", "name": "LENNY", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because you were never going to give it to him!", "name": "BEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Yusuf stands.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Bea grabs his wrist.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yusuf. Please.", "name": "BEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "He sits.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Lenny pours coffee, three cups, his hand steady.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Eat something, both of you.", "name": "LENNY", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}]}